# Remove Trailing Whitespace

Always remove trailing whitespace from all files when editing or creating code.

## Guidelines

- Remove trailing spaces and tabs at the end of lines
- Remove trailing whitespace from blank lines
- Ensure files end with a newline character (if the file format requires it)

## Examples

```python
# ❌ BAD - has trailing spaces
def example():    
    return True  

# ✅ GOOD - no trailing whitespace
def example():
    return True
```

```javascript
// ❌ BAD - has trailing spaces
const value = 'test';    

// ✅ GOOD - no trailing whitespace
const value = 'test';
```

When editing files, always clean up any trailing whitespace you encounter or create.
